        "value": "<p>Method - Immunobolt</p>\n<table style=\"width: 99%; height: 285.2px; border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 52.8px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Observation</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Result</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Unit</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Bio Ref. Range</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GM1</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GM2</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GM3</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GD1a</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GD1b</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GT1b</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 31.4268%; padding: 1px;\">GQ1b</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 22.6273%; padding: 1px;\">Negative</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 13.1992%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9981%; padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Comments</strong></span></h1>\n<p>Guillain-Barre syndrome is one class of Autoimmune peripheral neuropathies that comprises a spectrum of disorders including Acute inflammatory demyelinating polyradiculoneuropathy, Acute motor Axonal neuropathy, Miller Fisher syndrome &amp; Acute Motor &amp; Sensory Axonal Neuropathy. These are characterized by acute onset and show presence of Ganglioside antibodies particularly against GM1, Asialo GM1 &amp; GD1b. These antibodies lead to immune mediated damage to the peripheral nerves</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99%; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Antibodies</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Immunoglobulin in Class</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Associated Disease</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">GM1</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">IgM</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Multifocal motor neuropathy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">GM1, GD1a, GT1b</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">IgM, IgG, IgA</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Guillain - Barre syndrome</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">GQ1b</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">IgG</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Miller - Fisher syndrome</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">GD1b</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">IgG</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Sensory neuropathy</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Uses</strong><br>This assay supports the diagnosis of Neurological diseases specially Primary motor neuron disease &amp; Motor neuropathy</p>",
